# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Since the default liquidation threshold of a newly added market is 0, a borrower would have a collateral requirement of 0 (token price X * quantity * liquidation threshold(0) = 0). The borrower can then immediately snap all the inventory supplied by having any non-zero collateral, creating bad debt for the protocol.

